3-----Ask for the total bill. If the bill is ₹1000 or more, give a 10% discount. Otherwise, no discount.



bill = float(input("Enter total bill: "))

if bill >= 1000:
    discount = bill * 0.10
    final_bill = bill - discount
else:
    final_bill = bill

print("Final Bill =", final_bill)






